# Two aerodynamic coupling points are required for every DUST hinge.
# They are massless dynamic nodes placed at the physical hinge endpoints.
# MBDyn external structural forces accept dynamic nodes only; every one of
# these six-DOF nodes is fully constrained by its companion rigid joint.
# The companion joints make each pair follow its MBDyn control-surface node.

